      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我今天鼻子有点儿不舒服。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "是不是昨天晚上着凉了？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可能吧。早上起来就一直打喷嚏。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先去药店买点儿纸巾吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我还想买一个新的温度计。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "家里的坏了吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "没有坏，但是太旧了，我不太放心。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那换一个新的也好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还需要买别的吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先不用买太多。回家多喝水，好好休息。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果明天还不舒服呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "如果越来越不舒服，就去医院看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好。我现在其实没有发烧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就别太担心，今天早点儿回家。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我本来还想去咖啡馆学习。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天先取消吧，休息更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我听你的。买完东西就回家。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc015_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样最好，明天再看感觉。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
